Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's a turtle under the Mile\Nwho remembers when the tunnels were rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:08.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nib says Old Moss remembers everything.\NEven the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,I asked him how to get home faster.\NHe laughed for a full minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:22.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then he said: the lift goes up, little stray. But debts\Nonly fall if you stop counting his way. Count what HE\Ncounts, not what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:27.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,On the way back, I heard her. Just once.\NMy name, from above.
